  "description": "After a traumatic incident in high school left Se-Jin with emotional scars (and a three-year delay), all he wants now is to quietly graduate from Korea’s top university with decent grades. But what was supposed to be his easiest class turns into a paired project from hell, and who just so happens to be his teammate? The overly friendly, overly handsome Wu-Hyeon, of course! Not only is this guy clingy like lost puppy, but there’s something about him that puts Se-Jin on edge… Why does Wu-Hyeon seem so familiar, and how does he know so much about Se-Jin…? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
